{"type":"message","id":"9e765367","parentId":"a70c11d9","timestamp":"2026-09-05T13:48:42.595Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"可以。把 VS Code 預設會攔截的 command 從清單移除即可；但它是按 **command ID** 設定，沒有單一「terminal 時全部不送 VS Code」的開關。\n\n例如常用的：\n\n```json\n\"terminal.integrated.commandsToSkipShell\": [\n  \"-workbench.action.quickOpen\",\n  \"-workbench.action.showCommands\",\n  \"-workbench.action.files.openFile\",\n  \"-workbench.action.gotoLine\"\n]\n```\n\n分別讓 terminal 裡的 `Ctrl+P`、`Ctrl+Shift+P`、`Ctrl+O`、`Ctrl+G` 傳給 shell。\n\n若想確保某一鍵一定送出控制字元，也可以用 keybinding 覆寫：\n\n```json\n{\n  \"key\": \"ctrl+p\",\n  \"command\": \"workbench.action.terminal.sendSequence\",\n  \"args\": { \"text\": \"\\u0010\" },\n  \"when\": \"terminalFocus\"\n}\n```\n\n`\\u0010` 就是 Ctrl+P。","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_02e6dbadfdc1515a016a9c1db64ce087d0ba0a30b0770e8f45\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.6-terra","usage":{"input":6032,"output":228,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":0,"totalTokens":6260,"cost":{"input":0.012064,"output":0.002736,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.0148}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1788616116950,"responseId":"resp_02e6dbadfdc1515a016a9c1db57b1887d0952d160dd09fef2d","rawStopReason":"completed"}}
